<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 30,000T of Brazilian soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 30,000T of Brazilian soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A South Korean buyers group, known as the Big Feed Mills, bought 30,000 tonnes of Brazilian soymeal at $277.50 a tonne C&amp;F, officials of the buyers group said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The buyers said they bought the soymeal from Continental Grain through a private negotiation late Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for September 1-20 from South America and arrival was slated for October 30 to South Korean ports of Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
